import hashlib
from collections import Counter
ROUTES = {'/assessment': 10, '/mypage': 100}   # 새 시스템으로 보낼 비율(%)
def route(path, user_id):
    pct = next((v for k, v in ROUTES.items() if path.startswith(k)), 0)
    bucket = int(hashlib.md5(str(user_id).encode()).hexdigest(), 16) % 100
    return 'new' if bucket < pct else 'rails'
for p in ['/assessment/1', '/mypage', '/top']:
    print(p, dict(Counter(route(p, u) for u in range(1000))))
# /assessment/1 {'rails': 896, 'new': 104}
# /mypage {'new': 1000}
# /top {'rails': 1000}

